{
  "title": "How a game save file works",
  "hook": "Ever wonder how a game remembers exactly where you stopped?",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "Ever wonder how a game remembers exactly where you stopped?",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "title",
        "headline": "Save file secrets",
        "subhead": "Press start",
        "setting": "arcade",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "knox",
            "pose": "think",
            "position": "center"
          }
        ],
        "camera": "push-in",
        "emphasis": [
          "remembers"
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "It's way simpler than you think. The game writes a tiny note about you.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "hero",
        "headline": "A tiny note",
        "setting": "bedroom",
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "pencil"
          },
          {
            "kind": "book"
          }
        ],
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "sage",
            "pose": "talk",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "ref": "knox",
            "pose": "idle",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "slide",
        "camera": "static"
      },
      "speaker": "sage"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "That note holds your level, your health, where you stand, and what's in your bag.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "list",
        "headline": "What's in the note",
        "items": [
          "Your level",
          "Your health",
          "Where you stand",
          "What's in your bag"
        ],
        "setting": "dungeon",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "knox",
            "pose": "point",
            "position": "center"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "wipe",
        "camera": "static"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "A save can be tiny, way smaller than one photo.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "big-number",
        "number": {
          "value": 3,
          "suffix": " KB",
          "label": "A small save"
        },
        "setting": "space",
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "box"
          }
        ],
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "boone",
            "pose": "shock",
            "position": "center"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "zoom",
        "camera": "static"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "Knox asked where it goes, and Sage said it sits on your drive until the game reads it back.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "dialogue",
        "setting": "town",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "knox",
            "pose": "shrug",
            "position": "left",
            "line": "So where does it go?"
          },
          {
            "ref": "sage",
            "pose": "talk",
            "position": "right",
            "line": "Your drive. The game reads it back later."
          }
        ],
        "transition": "slide",
        "camera": "static"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "Loading runs it backwards: find the note, read the numbers, put everything back.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "process",
        "headline": "Loading",
        "items": [
          "Find the note",
          "Read the numbers",
          "Put it all back"
        ],
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "magnifier"
          },
          {
            "kind": "book"
          },
          {
            "kind": "check"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "arcade",
        "transition": "wipe",
        "camera": "static"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "That's the trick behind cloud saves: a copy of the note lives somewhere safe.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "reveal",
        "headline": "Cloud save",
        "emphasis": [
          "cloud"
        ],
        "props": [
          {
            "kind": "cloud"
          }
        ],
        "setting": "space",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "lyra",
            "pose": "cheer",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "iris",
        "camera": "static"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "So copy your save before something risky. Comment the game you'd never risk.",
      "visual": {
        "layout": "cta",
        "headline": "Back up your save",
        "subhead": "Comment your game",
        "setting": "forest",
        "characters": [
          {
            "ref": "knox",
            "pose": "cheer",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "ref": "lyra",
            "pose": "wave",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "camera": "static",
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    }
  ],
  "cta": "Comment the game you'd never risk."
}